The old “one known issue, one fix queued” account was contradicted by the tenant-based live table.
The deduplicated export has two causes, now filed separately:

- [Parser ticket #1](https://github.com/prophen/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1): month-first parsing for day-first tenants.
- [Form-hint ticket #2](https://github.com/prophen/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2): booking-v3 prints MM/DD/YYYY but reads tenant-local dates.

